1
00:00:00,812 --> 00:00:02,942
(Raj:)This is turning out to be
a perfect Saturday.

2
00:00:03,106 --> 00:00:04,606
(Howard:)Good, I'm glad.

3
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:10,740
(Howard:)Oh, man. Did you see the way
she smiled at me?

4
00:00:11,781 --> 00:00:13,531
(Raj:)Fine. Go ahead.

5
00:00:13,699 --> 00:00:15,369
(Howard:)No. This is our day.

6
00:00:15,535 --> 00:00:18,825
If you wanna chase after her,
chase after her.

7
00:00:19,288 --> 00:00:22,878
Oh, who am I kidding? I wouldn't
have a shot with a girl like that.

8
