(Raj:)Don't put yourself down.
You're very attractive.

9
00:00:25,795 --> 00:00:27,255
(Howard:)-You think so?
-Yeah.

10
00:00:27,421 --> 00:00:30,711
(Raj:)It wouldn't kill you to take a Pilates class
with me now and then...

11
00:00:30,883 --> 00:00:33,383
(Raj:)...but you have a certain wiry appeal.

12
00:00:33,553 --> 00:00:37,593
(Howard:)Yeah, well, it doesn't matter,
because she wasn't really smiling at me.

13
00:00:37,765 --> 00:00:39,225
(Raj:)In this case, I think she was.

14
00:00:39,684 --> 00:00:40,764
(Raj:)-Really?
-Yeah.

15
00:00:40,935 --> 00:00:42,225
(Leonard:)Bye.

16
00:00:44,814 --> 00:00:46,854
(Raj:)What a douche.

